      "output": "REQUIREMENTS.md has been written to the project root. Here's a summary of what it covers:\n\n**Feature**: Change the company name from \"Stellar Horizons\" to \"Stark Space\" across the entire space tourism website.\n\n**Key findings from codebase analysis**:\n- The current company name \"Stellar Horizons\" appears in **6 source files** and **3 test files** across the monorepo\n- Company branding is partially centralized in `packages/ui/src/constants/companyInfo.ts`, but also hardcoded as props in `App.tsx` and `LandingPage.tsx`\n- Affected areas: Navbar brand, Footer, Hero section, Features section title, Mission strip, feature card descriptions, HTML `<title>`, social media links, contact email, and address\n\n**Scope**: 6 in-scope capabilities (F1–F6) covering UI text, HTML metadata, constants, social links, feature card copy, and test assertions. All prioritized P0/P1.\n\n**5 User Stories** with Given/When/Then acceptance criteria covering navigation, footer, landing page content, browser tab, and contact information.\n\n**5 Open Questions** documented (Q1–Q5) covering tagline updates, social media handles, email format, address changes, and package name scope — all with default assumptions so implementation can proceed without blocking.",
